## Attribution

If you use this framework in your work, teaching, or tools, please:
1. Credit "Personal Operating System Framework"
2. Link back to the original repository
3. Share improvements back to the community

## Spirit of the License

This framework is designed to help people understand themselves better and live
more aligned lives. Use it freely:

- For personal self-discovery
- To help friends and family
- In coaching/teaching practices
- To build tools and apps
- In workshops and courses (free or paid)

We ask that you:
- Keep the core principles intact
- Don't claim you invented the framework
- Share learnings and improvements back
- Help others discover this resource

Thank you for being part of this community.
